fault":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097162,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTcxNjI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/discussion","name":"discussion","color":"ccaaff","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":283518733,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyODM1MTg3MzM=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/usability","name":"usability","color":"447744","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":10,"created_at":"2026-04-25T12:23:48Z","updated_at":"2026-08-16T16:36:29Z","closed_at":"2026-08-16T13:45:06Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118951","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118951","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118951.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118951.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"Yo whaaat, look at me touching C++ files!!!! Genuinely my first time. Be gentle!\r\n\r\nAnyway, it is my opinion that only features that are used often & emphasize 'the godot way' get icons so that, from a usability perspective, it is easier for users to spot common operations. I've been reviewing a few PRs where icons are added and / or removed, and was really bothered by the scene tree's context menu in particular. And so I dared to enter C++ land to make this PR!\r\n\r\n| **Before** | **After** |\r\n|--------|--------|\r\n| <img width=\"494\" height=\"643\" alt=\"Screenshot 2026-04-25 at 14 12 35\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3052b866-0c78-4855-bff6-d61e959dc2a2\" /> | <img width=\"497\" height=\"640\" alt=\"Screenshot 2026-04-25 at 14 11 20\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f67a356f-c5c7-4137-b791-d01fcd4e1c1c\" /> |\r\n| <img width=\"486\" height=\"551\" alt=\"Screenshot 2026-04-25 at 14 12 43\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/dd5047d6-f1d5-44f2-b171-255b6917a5a7\" /> | <img width=\"494\" height=\"549\" alt=\"Screenshot 2026-04-25 at 14 11 35\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/66bee5e7-8c2c-4ab8-b5cc-85eec5e9c9d7\" /> |\r\n\r\nOpen to feedback! Maybe I removed one icon too many? Should more icons go? Leave a comment.\r\n\r\n\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"AdriaandeJongh","id":5611323,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2MTEzMjM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5611323?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh","html_url":"https://github.com/AdriaandeJongh","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118951/reactions","total_count":8,"+1":4,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":4,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/1189